{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_mineshaft","model_identifier":"dwarf_mineshaft","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_mineshaft\n\nDwarf mineshaft: a carved stone portal cut into a rock face, a dark adit with timber props, rails running out of it and an ore cart.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 6 columns (128 x 96 units, 3.60 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -76..78, y 0..140, z -80..48 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 30, construction_0 25, construction_33 35, construction_66 38, ruined 22 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- rock face: 154 x 140 x 56 centred at x 0, z 20 (the adit at z -8 is the entrance)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `dwarf_mineshaft_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `dwarf_mineshaft_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_dwarf_mineshaft` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -16)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -84)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"rock","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-64.0,0.0,-8.0],"to":[64.0,120.0,48.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,144.0,120.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[144.0,0.0,200.0,120.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,144.0,120.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[144.0,0.0,200.0,120.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,242.0,128.0,298.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,242.0,128.0,298.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"899487fb-b323-5570-a4cb-86934e4c5cd1"},{"name":"rock_top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-52.0,120.0,0.0],"to":[52.0,140.0,44.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[30.0,298.0,134.0,318.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[134.0,298.0,178.0,318.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[30.0,298.0,134.0,318.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[134.0,298.0,178.0,318.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[132.0,242.0,236.0,286.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[132.0,242.0,236.0,286.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3507889e-7e27-5ab4-ab2e-515152e1f5c0"},{"name":"rock_l","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-76.0,0.0,0.0],"to":[-64.0,80.0,40.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[119.0,150.0,131.0,230.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[79.0,150.0,119.0,230.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[119.0,150.0,131.0,230.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[79.0,150.0,119.0,230.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,298.0,12.0,338.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,298.0,12.0,338.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9f35a32a-4c20-5d32-80f0-e9e3faffc2cd"},{"name":"rock_r","box_uv":false,"rescale